<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Into the Dark NordKapp NATO, 1985</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Into The Dark, NordKapp, 1985&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;I style="mso-bidi-font-style: normal"&gt;&lt;U&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN"&gt;Created Under Version 1.14 -&amp;nbsp;Build 998.10&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/U&gt;&lt;/I&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Al “Beirutdude” Sandrik&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;The Time Is: 24 December 1985, 20:00 Zulu/22:00 Murmansk Time&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"&gt;Nordkapp/Norwegian Sea&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"&gt;Playable as either NATO or Soviet Union&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"&gt;Up to 2 Days Duration&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;STRONG&gt;Thanks to AlexGGGG for his help!&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;So before you read on, this is not a balanced game scenario, rather it is a simulation of what I think the first few days of a sudden, "Bolt out of the Blue," Warsaw Pact attack would be like from both sides. On the NATO side there is chaos as the situation heats up, but NATO will never catch up. The test for the NATO Player is to do their best in an escalating situation, but winning is based on how well you hold up, not defeating the enemy. If that doesn't appeal to you I suggest the Soviet side!&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"&gt;Background: On December 18th&lt;SUP&gt; &lt;/SUP&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;the terrorist bombing of the Golani Brigade Headquarters on the Golan Heights, with a massive death toll, lead to the IDF assault on Syrian and Hezbollah positions in Lebanon and Syria itself. By Christmas Eve the front on the Golan had stabilized about 20 miles east of the Purple Line but the staunch American support for Israel had finally pushed the Politburo to the breaking point.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;Realizing the Reagan military buildup was pushing the correlation of conventional forces away from their advantage and toward NATO the Kremlin decided it was time to act. At Noon, Moscow time, on December 24th the word went out to all commands to execute “Operation Rhine” the “Bolt Out of the Blue” attack from barracks, airfields and ports with no notice. The Soviet Union (Warsaw Pact) would achieve strategic, operational and, for the most part, tactical surprise on all fronts with NATO caught massively out of position. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;This Scenarion is one aspect of the&amp;nbsp;NATO “Pearl Harbor…”&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;1.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT: 7pt 'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;There are two versions, one for NATO and one for the USSR, so&amp;nbsp;you can play either as the human player. The only difference is the victory conditions.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;2.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT: 7pt 'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Warning, do not delete locked reference points as they are necessary for events.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;3.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT: 7pt 'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;There is a six hour window before the likely onset of combat were things slowly heat up. Use this time to set up your missions an change load outs to your liking. &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;4.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; There is a teleport so let the game run for a few seconds before giving orders.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;5.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT: 7pt 'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Set the Game Options to…&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 1in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1; mso-add-space: auto"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;a.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT: 7pt 'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Set Popups to allow Special Messages to be viewed.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 1in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1; mso-add-space: auto"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;b.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT: 7pt 'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;NATO Human, to ensure you get the Special Message pop ups for lost units before the actual hostilities begin please uncheck the popups for units lost (at least until the actual fighting begins).&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 1in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1; mso-add-space: auto"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 1in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1; mso-add-space: auto"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN"&gt;Created Under Version 1.14 -&amp;nbsp;Build 998.10&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 1in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1; mso-add-space: auto"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Al “BeirutDude” Sandrik (ex-Beachinnole)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Al.Sandrik@gmail.com&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
